    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO FROM THE PACIFIC, GOLDEN GATE, G. G. BRIDGE, BUSINESS DISTRICT,\n41\n8A-H3156\nSAN FRANCISCO-OAKLAND BAY BRIDGE, OAKLAND, BERKELEY, ALAMEDA AND EAST BAY CITIES IN DISTANCE",
